-| $\boldsymbol{\tau}_{\mathrm{direct}}$ | direct torque | $\mathrm{s^{-1}}$ |
-| $\Delta t$ | integration timestep | $\mathrm{s}$ |
+| $\boldsymbol\tau_{\mathrm{direct}}$ | direct RHS torque | $\mathrm{s^{-1}}$ |
